            "body": "@KodyVB Does this work for you?  \r\n`vim.fn.tabpagenr('$')` gives the total number of tabs,  \r\nwhile `vim.fn.tabpagenr()` gives the current tab number.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/KodyVB/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/KodyVB\">@KodyVB</a> Does this work for you?<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">vim.fn.tabpagenr('$')</code> gives the total number of tabs,<br>\nwhile <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.fn.tabpagenr()</code> gives the current tab number.</p>",
            "bodyText": "@KodyVB Does this work for you?\nvim.fn.tabpagenr('$') gives the total number of tabs,\nwhile vim.fn.tabpagenr() gives the current tab number.",
